<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 12-MAR.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 12-MAR.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Justin, with 50 mph winds, is in the Coral Sea near 16.5s/151.5e, and nearly stationary. Little change in strength or little movement is expected during the next 48 hours. Justin will threaten shipping through the period as seas in the region will continue quite rough.</p>
</text>
